#: src/reference/reference/sbt-publish.md:148
msgid ""
"````admonish note\n"
"Credentials matching is done using both: `realm` and `host` keys.\n"
"The `realm` key is the HTTP `WWW-Authenticate` header's realm directive, "
"which is\n"
"part of the response of HTTP servers for [HTTP Basic Authentication](https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Basic_access_authentication#Server_side).\n"
"For a given repository, this can be found by reading all the headers "
"received.\n"
"For example:\n"
"\n"
"```bash\n"
"curl -D - my.artifact.repo.net\n"
"```\n"
"````"
msgstr ""
"````admonish note\n"
"凭据匹配使用 `realm` 和 `host` 两个键。\n"
"`realm` 键是 HTTP `WWW-Authenticate` 头的 realm 指令，\n"
"是 HTTP 服务器对 [HTTP Basic Authentication](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Basic_access_authentication#Server_side) 响应的一部分。\n"
"对于给定仓库，可通过读取收到的所有头来找到。\n"
"例如：\n"
"\n"
"```bash\n"
"curl -D - my.artifact.repo.net\n"
"```\n"
"````"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt-publish.md:160
msgid "Cross-publishing"
msgstr "交叉发布"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt-publish.md:162
msgid ""
"To support multiple incompatible Scala versions, use projectMatrix and "
"publish (see [Cross building setup](./cross-building-setup.md))."
msgstr ""
"要支持多个不兼容的 Scala 版本，请使用 projectMatrix 和 publish（参见 [Cross building "
"setup](./cross-building-setup.md)）。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt-publish.md:165
msgid "Overriding the publishing convention"
msgstr "覆盖发布约定"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt-publish.md:167
msgid ""
"By default sbt will publish your artifact with the binary version of Scala "
"you're using. For example if your project is using Scala 2.13.x your example "
"artifact would be published under `example_2.13`. This is often what you "
"want, but if you're publishing a pure Java artifact or a compiler plugin "
"you'll want to change the `CrossVersion`. See the [Cross building setup](./"
"cross-building-setup.md) page for more details under the _Publishing "
"convention_ section."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，sbt 会使用您正在使用的 Scala 二进制版本发布构件。例如，若项目使用 "
"Scala 2.13.x，示例构件将发布为 `example_2.13`。这通常是您想要的，但若发布纯 Java "
"构件或编译器插件，您需要更改 `CrossVersion`。详见 [Cross building setup](./cross-"
"building-setup.md) 页面的 _Publishing convention_ 部分。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt-publish.md:175
msgid "Published artifacts"
msgstr "已发布构件"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt-publish.md:177
msgid ""
"By default, the main binary JAR, a sources JAR, and a API documentation JAR "
"are published. You can declare other types of artifacts to publish and "
"disable or modify the default artifacts. See the [Artifact](./artifact.md) "
"page for details."
msgstr ""
"默认发布主二进制 JAR、源码 JAR 和 API 文档 JAR。您可声明要发布的其他类型构件，并"
"禁用或修改默认构件。详见 [Artifact](./artifact.md) 页面。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt-publish.md:182
msgid "Version scheme"
msgstr "版本方案"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt-publish.md:184
msgid "`versionScheme` setting tracks the version scheme of the build:"
msgstr ""
"`versionScheme` 设置跟踪构建的版本方案："

#: src/reference/reference/sbt-publish.md:187
msgid "\"early-semver\""
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/reference/sbt-publish.md:190
msgid ""
"The supported values are `\"early-semver\"`, `\"pvp\"`, `\"semver-spec\"`, "
"and `\"strict\"`. sbt will include this information into `pom.xml` and "
"`ivy.xml` as a property."
msgstr ""
"支持的值有 `\"early-semver\"`、`\"pvp\"`、`\"semver-spec\"` 和 `\"strict\"`。"
"sbt 会将此信息作为属性包含到 `pom.xml` 和 `ivy.xml` 中。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt-publish.md:193
msgid ""
"`Some(\"early-semver\")`: Early Semantic Versioning that would keep binary "
"compatibility across patch updates within 0.Y.z (for instance 0.13.0 and "
"0.13.2). Once it goes 1.0.0, it follows the regular Semantic Versioning "
"where 1.1.0 is bincompat with 1.0.0."
msgstr ""
"`Some(\"early-semver\")`：早期语义化版本，在 0.Y.z 内保持补丁更新间的二进制兼容（如 "
"0.13.0 与 0.13.2）。达到 1.0.0 后遵循常规语义化版本，1.1.0 与 1.0.0 二进制兼容。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt-publish.md:194
msgid ""
"`Some(\"semver-spec\")`: Semantic Versioning where all 0.y.z are treated as "
"initial development (no bincompat guarantees)."
msgstr ""
"`Some(\"semver-spec\")`：语义化版本，所有 0.y.z 视为初始开发（无二进制兼容保证）。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt-publish.md:195
msgid ""
"`Some(\"pvp\")`. Haskell Package Versioning Policy where X.Y are treated as "
"major version."
msgstr ""
"`Some(\"pvp\")`：Haskell 包版本策略，X.Y 视为主版本。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt-publish.md:196
msgid "`Some(\"strict\")`. Requires exact match of version."
msgstr ""
"`Some(\"strict\")`：要求版本完全匹配。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt-publish.md:198
msgid ""
"This information will be annotated into the `pom.xml` file, which helps "
"downstream projects determine whether a version conflict is safe to resolve "
"or not. See [Preventing version conflicts with versionScheme](https://"
"www.scala-lang.org/blog/2021/02/16/preventing-version-conflicts-with-"
"versionscheme.html) (2021)."
msgstr ""
"此信息将标注到 `pom.xml` 文件中，便于下游项目判断版本冲突是否可安全解析。"
"参见 [Preventing version conflicts with versionScheme](https://www.scala-lang.org/"
"blog/2021/02/16/preventing-version-conflicts-with-versionscheme.html) (2021)。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt-publish.md:202
msgid "Modifying the generated POM"
msgstr "修改生成的 POM"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt-publish.md:204
msgid ""
"When `publishMavenStyle` is `true`, a POM is generated by the `makePom` "
"action and published to the repository instead of an Ivy file. This POM file "
"may be altered by changing a few settings. Set `pomExtra` to provide XML "
"(`scala.xml.NodeSeq`) to insert directly into the generated pom. For example:"
msgstr ""
"当 `publishMavenStyle` 为 `true` 时，POM 由 `makePom` 操作生成并发布到仓库而非 Ivy "
"文件。可通过修改若干设置来更改此 POM 文件。设置 `pomExtra` 提供 XML（`scala.xml."
"NodeSeq`）以直接插入生成的 pom。例如："

#: src/reference/reference/sbt-publish.md:214
msgid ""
"There is also a `pomPostProcess` setting that can be used to manipulate the "
"final XML before it is written. It's type is `Node => Node`."
msgstr ""
"还有 `pomPostProcess` 设置可用于在写入前操作最终 XML。其类型为 `Node => Node`。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt-publish.md:223
msgid ""
"`makePom` adds to the POM any Maven-style repositories you have declared. "
"You can filter these by modifying `pomRepositoryFilter`, which by default "
"excludes local repositories. To instead only include local repositories:"
msgstr ""
"`makePom` 将您声明的所有 Maven 风格仓库添加到 POM。可通过修改 `pomRepositoryFilter` "
"过滤这些仓库，默认排除本地仓库。若要仅包含本地仓库："

